---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { articles, projects, formatDate } from '../data/site';
const posts = await articles();
---
<Base><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> AI INFRA / EFFICIENT INTELLIGENCE</p><h1>在模型与系统之间，<br/>寻找效率的<span>空间。</span></h1><p class="lead">你好，我是文氓（WenMang）。关注模型压缩、推理加速与软硬件协同。<br/>在这里分享做过的项目，也记录值得反复思考的问题。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/articles/">阅读技术文章 <span>↗</span></a><a class="quiet" href="/projects/">探索项目 →</a></div><p class="hero-foot">ALWAYS LEARNING <span>最近关注 · Agent 与高效推理</span></p></div><aside class="terminal"><div class="terminal-top"><span>● ● ●</span><span>exploration.log</span></div><p><b>01</b> 理解模型 <span>MODEL</span></p><p><b>02</b> 优化计算 <span>COMPUTE</span></p><p><b>03</b> 连接系统 <span>SYSTEM</span></p><div class="terminal-bottom">想法 → 实验 → 实现 → 记录<span class="cursor"></span></div></aside></section>
<div class="topic-strip"><span>LLM INFERENCE</span><span>MODEL COMPRESSION</span><span>MULTIMODAL</span><span>HARDWARE CO-DESIGN</span></div>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / WRITING</p><h2>最近写下的思考</h2></div><a class="quiet" href="/articles/">全部文章 ↗</a></div><div class="article-list">{posts.slice(0,3).map((post,i) => <a class="article-row" href={post.href}><span class="row-num">0{i+1}</span><div><div class="meta">{formatDate(post.date)} · {post.tags.join(' / ')}</div><h3>{post.title}</h3><p>{post.description}</p></div><span class="arrow">↗</span></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / SELECTED PROJECTS</p><h2>把想法放进代码里</h2></div><a class="quiet" href="/projects/">全部项目 ↗</a></div><div class="project-grid">{projects.slice(0,3).map((p,i) => <article class="project-card"><a href={`https://github.com/WenMang98k/${p.repo}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div class={`project-art art-${i}`}><span>{p.mark}<em>.</em></span><small>{p.category} ↗</small></div><div class="meta">{p.category} / {p.status}</div><h3>{p.name} ↗</h3><p>{p.description}</p><small class="stack">{p.stack}</small></a></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="closing"><p class="eyebrow">KEEP EXPLORING</p><h2>技术之外，也保持好奇。</h2><p>工作经历、运动、摄影，以及更多关于我的记录。</p><a class="quiet" href="/about/">认识更多面的我 ↗</a><span> · </span><a class="quiet" href="/tech/">技术主题 ↗</a><span> · </span><a class="quiet" href="/life/">生活记录 ↗</a></section></Base>
